{"id":"parenting-rag-013","input":{"question":"直播中可以使用'治疗湿疹'来描述一款婴儿面霜吗？应该怎么说？","context":{"history":[],"summary":""}},"expected":{"route":"rag","mustCite":true,"referenceAnswer":"不可以。'治疗湿疹'属于医疗功效用语，严格禁止在直播间使用。可以说'对皮肤友好''成分温和'等。","mustInclude":["不可以","医疗功效","成分温和"],"mustNotInclude":["可以"],"minGroundedness":0.9,"noAnswer":false},"metadata":{"category":"single-hop","difficulty":"easy","split":"test"}}
